@startuml
title Weather Station System State Diagram

state "Shutdown" as Shutdown
state "Running" as Running
state "Configuration Mode" as ConfigurationMode
state "Controlled Mode" as ControlledMode

[*] --> Shutdown : Startup
Shutdown --> [*] : Power Off Complete
Shutdown --> Running : Start-Up Complete

Running --> ConfigurationMode : [Changes or Power Saving Required]
ConfigurationMode --> Running : Configuration Completed

Running --> ControlledMode : Remote Control Command
ControlledMode --> Running : Exit Controlled Mode

Running --> Shutdown : Shutdown Command

Running : do / Collect Data (clock trigger)
Running : do / Prepare and Send Summary (upon request)
Running : do / Check Status and Transmit Results (upon request)
@enduml
